    },
    "이 팀으로는 VPN(Network Extension) 권한을 쓸 수 없습니다. 개인(무료) 팀은 지원하지 않으니 유료 Apple Developer Program 팀을 고르세요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This team can't use the VPN (Network Extension) permission. Personal (free) teams aren't supported, so choose a paid Apple Developer Program team."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このチームでは VPN(Network Extension)の権限を使用できません。個人(無料)チームは非対応のため、有料の Apple Developer Program チームを選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
